<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! library.collection.resolves ~ a reference names; this verb paths it for a caller

`lares library path <collection>` resolves `library:<collection>` to its directory under the library home, for a caller that needs a path. A reference names, it never paths: `library:mark-twain` travels, a directory does not.

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/shows`>>

!! shows ~ path

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`example` name=`path` params=`collection/mark-twain ~ print the directory of one collection`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ collection

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`collection` params=`takes/name needs/required seat/1 as/<collection> ~ the collection`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ local

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`local` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ reads this host's own library home; this handler checks no ocap`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/refuses`>>

!! refuses ~ usage

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`refusal` name=`usage` params=`cure/[[library.collection.resolves collection/mark-twain]] ~ no collection named`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/answers`>>

!! answers ~ resolved

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`band` name=`resolved` params=`exit/0 fields/[[ref dir]] ~ the reference and its directory`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares library path

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares library path]] ~ the terminal`>>
```

